SteamBridge uses SteamKit2 (LGPL-2.1-only; see the exact downloaded source).
Download engines are separate open-source executables: Legendary (GPL-3.0),
heroic-gogdl (GPL-3.0), Nile (GPL-3.0), DepotDownloader (GPL-2.0 or the license
recorded in its pinned source). Their complete upstream sources, versions and
archive hashes are obtained by Scripts/store_bootstrap.py. Each dependency's
actual license is authoritative; no binary release is authorized by this notice.

Storefront metadata only proves macOS availability, not Apple Silicon support.
Mach-O inspection is mandatory before labelling a downloaded macOS build native.
